{"candidateAnswer":"Portland, Denver, Los Angeles","evidence":"[D3:19 | 4:21 pm on 16 July, 2023] John: It's Seattle, I'm stoked for my game there next month! It's one of my favorite cities to explore - super vibrant!\n[D6:3 | 1:08 pm on 11 August, 2023] John: I was in Chicago, it was awesome! It had so much energy and the locals were really friendly. It's great to experience other cultures and connect with new folks.\n[D9:6 | 6:59 pm on 26 August, 2023] John: Wow, Tim, that's an awesome book collection! It's cool to escape to different worlds with a hobby. By the way, I love discovering new cities - check out this pic from one of my trips to New York City!","itemId":"urn:uuid:53b70afb-b938-581f-816b-38958f7765af","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:1f9e53054102e16cab59a1462f5e3b2c977bf2170082cc0a9cee1c975265ecbc","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Which US cities does John mention visiting to Tim?","referenceAnswer":"Seattle, Chicago, New York","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"1f9e53054102e16cab59a1462f5e3b2c977bf2170082cc0a9cee1c975265ecbc"}}]}